{"id":"n88009-1-8","stage":5,"title":"화사하다 · 明媚","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88009-1-8-1","ko":"이젠 정말 봄이 찾아온 모양이야.","zh":"看来春天真的到来了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이젠","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봄이","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아온","meaning":"降临，到来","explanation":"찾아오다：降临，到来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"3","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이야.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"降临，到来","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"(喻义)某个时期重新归来。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/5bef78f77b419975d495.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88009-1-8-2","ko":"네, 길거리에도 화사한 봄옷을 입은 사람들이 부쩍 늘었어요.","zh":"是的，街上穿着鲜艳春装的人也明显变多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길거리에도","meaning":"大街，街头，马路","explanation":"길거리：大街，街头，马路；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"길거리","audio":"/audio/86c04676580d73caed6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43877","senseId":"1","lemma":"길거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화사한","meaning":"明媚，华丽","explanation":"화사하다：明媚，华丽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"화사하다","audio":"/audio/5bbdcb1b42824ede7a22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88009","senseId":"1","lemma":"화사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봄옷을","meaning":"春装","explanation":"봄옷：春装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"봄옷","audio":"/audio/bdea40c0a7dcb7003187.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59836","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입은","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부쩍","meaning":"猛地，一下子","explanation":"부쩍：猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"부쩍","audio":"/audio/81b0ce3160def2f0f1ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60036","senseId":"1","lemma":"부쩍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘었어요.","meaning":"增加，上升","explanation":"늘다：增加，上升；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"86c04676580d73ca","term":"길거리","zh":"大街，街头，马路","audio":"/audio/86c04676580d73caed6d.mp3","entryId":"43877","definition":"供人或车马通行的道路。","pronunciation":["길꺼리"]},{"id":"5bbdcb1b42824ede","term":"화사하다","zh":"明媚，华丽","audio":"/audio/5bbdcb1b42824ede7a22.mp3","entryId":"88009","definition":"明亮美丽。","pronunciation":["화사하다"]},{"id":"bdea40c0a7dcb700","term":"봄옷","zh":"春装","audio":"/audio/bdea40c0a7dcb7003187.mp3","entryId":"59836","definition":"春季穿的衣服。","pronunciation":["보몯"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"81b0ce3160def2f0","term":"부쩍","zh":"猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/81b0ce3160def2f0f1ac.mp3","entryId":"60036","definition":"某事物或某现象突然发生巨大变化的样子。","pronunciation":["부쩍"]},{"id":"0a9915cd5915474e","term":"늘다","zh":"增加，上升","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3","entryId":"64492","definition":"数或量等变得比原来多。","pronunciation":["늘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5096eb62fe789a7f96f0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.322,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88009","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学